OL,3,AHow does it affect me if share prices
OL,4,Afall?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor tech firms have seen their stock
OL,7,Fvalues fall after a sell-off by
OL,8,Finvestors following the US midterm
OL,9,Felections.
OL,11,FThe fall in the value of their shares
OL,12,Facross the world has been blamed on an
OL,13,Fexpectation of a slowdown in AI
OL,14,Fdevelopment, although it comes after
OL,15,Fsharp rises over recent years.
OL,17,FAs companies grow, they may issue
OL,18,Fshares. Many of the largest companies
OL,19,Fin the UK have shares which are bought
OL,20,Fand sold on the London Stock Exchange.
